Implement normalization and deduplication logic:

1. Create a normalizer for event fields (title, venue, date)
2. Generate dedupeKey = normalize(title+venue+firstDate)
3. Implement fuzzy business matching based on name and address/city
4. Add confidence scoring for each field and overall candidate

Example implementation:
